  "title": {
   "en": "Takou no Koori Hime wo Tasuketara, Otomodachi kara Hajimeru Koto ni Narimashita"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "他校の氷姫を助けたら、お友達から始める事になりました"
   },
   {
    "en": "After Helping the \"Ice Princess\" From Another School, I Decided to Start as a Friend"
   },
   {
    "es-la": "Después de ayudar a la \"Princesa de hielo\" de otra escuela, decidimos empezar como amigos"
   },
   {
    "vi": "Sau khi giúp đỡ \"Công chúa băng giá\" từ trường khác, chúng tôi bắt đầu làm bạn."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Nagi Shinonome, known as the \"Ice Princess,\" is a beautiful girl with a cold attitude who does not allow others to get close to her. One day, Souta Minori, who saw her being molested on the train, saved her with all his courage, but the next day she appeared again and said, \"I want you to stay by my side.\" Can Souta continue as friends with the Ice Princess, who only sweetly melts for one person in the world, that is, himself?",
   "ja": "その可愛さは、\"お友達\"のあなただけに。\n\n冷たい態度で他人を寄せ付けない美少女【氷姫】こと東雲凪。ある日、そんな彼女が電車内で痴漢に遭っているのを目撃した俺・海似蒼太は、勇気を振り絞って彼女を助けたのだが、翌日再び彼女が現れて……。\n\n「そばにいて、欲しいんです」\n\n世界でたったひとり、自分にだけ甘く溶けていく【氷姫】と、蒼太は\"お友達\"であり続けられるのか!?"
  },
